                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "jBuo1",
                          "name": "t",
                          "fill": "#2B141C",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "角托染料池 mount-pool\nradial × 角托數（每個角托一顆）",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "600"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "blAA4",
                      "name": "C1",
                      "width": 300,
                      "padding": [
                        12,
                        14
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "EHpiW",
                          "name": "t",
                          "fill": "#2B141C",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "$mount-pool 0 → $mount-pool-0 1.0\nR = 角托邊長 × 3（直徑 = 角托 × 6，正圓；橢圓化是 R2 的實作瑕疵，本輪修正）\nopacity = 0.03 + 0.50 × lit(角座標)",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "$font-num",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "700"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "RmXf5",
                      "name": "C2",
                      "width": 434,
                      "padding": [
                        12,
                        14
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "R4bjBT",
                          "name": "t",
                          "fill": "#553040",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "窗光在 (55,17)、橢圓半徑 (668,1150)，單位是 pt 不是百分比。曬得多就褪得多；角托遮住的那個角染料留了下來，顏色最深。每顆池子的深度＝那個角的光強度——同一個 lit() 同時決定背景漸層與四角池子。\n【R4 · 池跟著角托走】角托規則改寫後（見母題節三段規則），有角托的紙才有池：邀請碼卡撤角托，四顆池一併撤；01／01b／01c／04／04-iPad／A11y-04 由 2 角補到 4 角，池同步補到 4 顆。全稿現在是 9 個節點 36 顆池，全部由 lit(viewport) 現算，無一手填。角托 58 顆（產品 32、標識 16、規格板 10）。\n【R3 · 座標系改成裝置】lit() 原本吃「元素在文件裡的位置」，frame 一長內容就掉進地板。改吃 viewport 之後，池子在捲動時會跟著變——窗光不動、紙在動。靜態稿一律量「首屏落點」。\n【地板與幅度】0.08→0.03、0.34→0.50。地板 0.08 在 834pt 寬的 iPad 上會變成一層假的均勻粉霧；0.03 等於「這裡沒有落差」。",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "xVnpy",
                      "name": "C3",
                      "width": 280,
                      "padding": [
                        12,
                        14
                      ],
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "RMt5e",
                          "name": "t",
                          "fill": "#553040",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "lit(p)=max(0,1−hypot((x−55)/668,(y−17)/1150))\n座標系＝viewport（裝置），不是文件。\n【R4 實測 opacity（TL/TR/BL/BR）】\n01／01c 相紙 .494/.288/.360/.236　01b .494/.288/.362/.238\n01-iPad 相紙 .418/.207/.132/.030（14 倍落差——那張紙躺在窗光的邊緣上）\n04 照片 .438/.287/.335/.232　04-iPad .403/.054/.173/.030　A11y-04 .312/.217/.225/.151\n07a 範例沖印品 .432/.277/.342/.230\n（06／06b／06c／07／07b／07c 的碼卡 R4 已撤池，不再列。）",
                          "lineHeight": 1.5,
                          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans TC",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
